/// Fold one value word into an option's ongoing value state.
///
/// `attached` marks the `--opt=value` / `-ovalue` spelling: that form closes
/// the occurrence after the word (clap rejects further value words), except
/// when the word ends with a dangling delimiter and another segment still
/// fits.  Space-separated words instead keep accepting values up to the range.
///
